  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Copernicus in Central Asia and Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of the Action is to support public authorities and relevant institutions and stakeholders in making effective use of Copernicus Earth observation data and developing locally adapted solutions to climate change-related, environmental and socio-economic issues. The Action will provide partner countries with tailor-made support, including capacity building for data analysis and processing, development of specific applications and provision of basic equipment. This will enable decision-makers in these regions to analyse data and trends, formulate relevant measures and make informed policy choices. Furthermore, the action will engage relevant stakeholders such as research institutions and private sector companies &#xbf; including female-led organisations &#xbf; to increase their awareness and encourage the use of Copernicus data while facilitating collaboration and partnerships&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
